Spec 12 Part B audit, sysparams.c: registry handles, the process DPI awareness, the process
layout, the display DC, the exiting thread and the thunk lock callback become per pseudo-process
(sysparams_ios.h); the iOS code of every Part is included at the end (sysparams_ios.inc).

--- a/dlls/win32u/sysparams.c
+++ b/dlls/win32u/sysparams.c
@@ -1,3 +1,5 @@
